            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for creating this! This should already by the case.\r\n\r\n> Currently, it seems to be triggered on InsertEnter.\r\n\r\nNot quite, [it uses `TextChangedI`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/b43e25bde7a63d3ab16c0e6ff7501c6459a9dfeb/lua/mini/files.lua#L1794) event for this.\r\n\r\nI'd guess that you are using Neovim nightly, right? Coincidentally, I've discovered this today. The root cause here seems to be neovim/neovim#25490. I'll wait some time to see if this gets resolved, because I tried to fix it regardless but couldn't find anything quickly.",
