            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should be now fixed on latest Neovim nightly. Albeit, with introduction of a slightly different issue in the same space: simply pressing `o` or `O` now don't change border color. This seems like a regression introduced in upstream vim after fixing original `TextChangedI` issue. It is tracked in vim/vim#13367, so should be taken care of eventually.",
